# Pivot
- From: one folder of dev/ per pull request (K7), after the calibration.
- To: logically sound sweeps: pass 1, the calibration on dev/vocabulary/
  (#1605); pass 2, a sweep through all headers and files, which carries
  the AGENTS.md rule; pass 3 for what pass 2 leaves, sized by its workload.
  A pass is cut by logic, never by file type.
- Why: trueqbit: one folder per pull request was never the intention, and
  a pull request giving nearly every file a header needs AGENTS.md to
  keep them.
- Invalidates: campaign.md "Commits and publication" (K7); the "Left out
  on purpose" of #1605; proposal-fnc12.md "Status". This commit and the
  two after it moved off #1605 onto this branch, with their notes.

